[12713,14.5,2011,26,82,27],[12714,16.1,2011,34,81,26]],"links":[["Terrell County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/terrell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, March to April and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025, on that same middle, January to February got 6% of normal and November to December got 5%. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2011, and grids 12110 and 12410 got 22% of normal that year.</p>"}
